   "customData": {
    "panel": "llm-call"
   },
   "text": "Prefill runs this recipe for every prompt token at once, so the math is the bottleneck. Decode runs it for one new token at a time,\nso reading the 16 GB of weights each step is the bottleneck. That one difference explains most of the speed cards.",
   "originalText": "Prefill runs this recipe for every prompt token at once, so the math is the bottleneck. Decode runs it for one new token at a time,\nso reading the 16 GB of weights each step is the bottleneck. That one difference explains most of the speed cards.",
